WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:08.146
I love autumn!

2
00:00:08.147 --> 00:00:10.668
I love the blue skies.

3
00:00:10.669 --> 00:00:17.839
This year we are going to Mt. Sorak to see the colorful leaves on the trees!

4
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:19.447
Dad: What are you doing?

5
00:00:19.448 --> 00:00:21.084
We're leaving soon.

6
00:00:21.085 --> 00:00:23.631
Bada: I don't want to go.

7
00:00:23.632 --> 00:00:25.941
Hana: Can Bada and I stay here?

8
00:00:25.942 --> 00:00:28.096
We don't want to go hiking.

9
00:00:28.097 --> 00:00:29.869
Mom: No, you can't.

10
00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:33.461
Besides, I know you'll love Mount Sorak.

11
00:00:33.462 --> 00:00:35.846
Mom: Now, come on!

12
00:00:35.847 --> 00:00:40.156
Hana: Wow! Look at the beautiful colors!

13
00:00:40.157 --> 00:00:43.161
Why do leaves change colors?

14
00:00:43.162 --> 00:00:47.820
Dad: Because the trees are getting ready for winter.

15
00:00:47.821 --> 00:00:52.307
Mom: All leaves have green, yellow, and orange in them.

16
00:00:52.308 --> 00:00:56.461
Mom: But in the summer, the green color is the strongest.

17
00:00:56.462 --> 00:00:57.794
Bada: Why?

18
00:00:57.795 --> 00:01:01.486
Mom: Because of the sun, and water from the tree.

19
00:01:01.487 --> 00:01:07.677
Mom: But when the weather gets cooler, the tree gets less sun and water.

20
00:01:07.678 --> 00:01:13.720
Dad: So the green fades, and the other colors like [n3@yellow and orange become brighter.

21
00:01:13.721 --> 00:01:15.940
Bada: Here's a red one!

22
00:01:15.941 --> 00:01:20.611
Mom: Yes! There are red and purple leaves too.

23
00:01:20.612 --> 00:01:24.864
Dad: Hana, you like maple syrup on your pancakes, right?

24
00:01:24.865 --> 00:01:28.176
Hana: Yummy! I love maple syrup.

25
00:01:28.177 --> 00:01:31.421
Mom: Well, that syrup comes from the trees!

26
00:01:31.422 --> 00:01:35.836
Hana: Wow! I never knew that!

27
00:01:35.837 --> 00:01:38.742
Dad: Bada! Pick that up!

28
00:01:38.743 --> 00:01:41.447
Mom: Never throw your garbage on the ground.

29
00:01:41.448 --> 00:01:42.856
Bada: But why?

30
00:01:42.857 --> 00:01:44.831
Dad: Do you throw garbage in your room?

31
00:01:44.832 --> 00:01:46.186
In your house?

32
00:01:46.187 --> 00:01:49.929
Bada: No, only in the trash can.

33
00:01:49.930 --> 00:01:52.768
Mom: Well, this is the trees' house.

34
00:01:52.769 --> 00:01:58.049
Mom: And it is home to the birds, squirrels, and other living things too.

35
00:01:58.050 --> 00:02:00.161
Mom: We mustn't make it dirty.

36
00:02:00.162 --> 00:02:01.972
Do you understand?

37
00:02:01.973 --> 00:02:07.472
Bada: Yes, Mommy. Sorry, little squirrel!

38
00:02:07.473 --> 00:02:10.498
Dad: Now, let's all take a picture.

39
00:02:10.499 --> 00:02:15.352
Hana & Bada: CHEESE!

40
00:02:15.353 --> 00:02:18.034
We spent three days in Mount Sorak.

41
00:02:18.035 --> 00:02:21.010
Mommy and Daddy taught us so much.

42
00:02:21.011 --> 00:02:25.508
We learned about trees, birds, and animals.

43
00:02:25.509 --> 00:02:31.470
I'm glad we didn't stay inside and watch TV.
